Depends: ${misc:Depends}, electron (>= 40), electron (<< 41), dbus, default-dbus-session-bus | dbus-session-bus, libglib2.0-bin, fontconfig
Recommends: fonts-noto-color-emoji
Description: independent desktop client for WhatsApp Web
 WhatsApp Web in a dedicated window with a system tray, desktop notifications,
 themes, configurable fonts and privacy controls. An existing WhatsApp account
 and an Internet connection are required.
 .
 This project is not affiliated with Meta or WhatsApp. The Electron runtime is
 supplied separately by the distribution rather than bundled in this package.
